{"data":[{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-11-04T08:31:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117897607431496176"],"id":"2117897607431496176","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":596,"like_count":21,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":2},"text":"我这么痛苦是因为我好想感到幸福啊","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2117897607431496176"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-11-04T08:15:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117893566341304741"],"id":"2117893566341304741","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":467,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"不想吃東西。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2117893566341304741"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-11-04T07:33:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117882866462040201"],"id":"2117882866462040201","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1017,"like_count":15,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"就这样，我被困在中间。\n爱被伤痕牵制，恨被幸福淹没。它们相互制衡，让我停在不上不下的僵局里，爱也爱不彻底，恨也恨不彻底。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2117882866462040201"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-11-04T07:20:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117879610348380384"],"id":"2117879610348380384","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":640,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我的精神状态像一个被肢解失敗而抛弃掉的尸体，东一块西一块，甚至有些已经找不到了。不知道是被畜牲吃掉了，还是已经烂化了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2117879610348380384"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-11-04T07:18:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117879159498452999"],"id":"2117879159498452999","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1050,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"其实我不想结束的 但是我没招了 而且我好累啊","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2117879159498452999"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-11-03T15:26:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117639473672700038"],"id":"2117639473672700038","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":262,"impression_count":101901,"like_count":3241,"quote_count":42,"reply_count":110,"retweet_count":334},"text":"其实断联太久的人已经不适合重逢了，我们都太小看时间的力量了，总认为三五年其实不算什么，可却足以让我们看清许多东西。不是不想见，是见了也不知道从哪聊起。我们缺席了彼此太久，记忆里那个人和眼前的这个人早就对不上了，能聊的只剩过去了，当下和未来都插不进去。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2117639473672700038"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-11-03T14:42:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117628580364685668"],"id":"2117628580364685668","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":954,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"昨天忘吃药了 记录戒断反应头晕，想吐。真的太晕了，下午四五点开始晕得不行，一直眩晕，下午六七点的时候特别想吐，半夜睡前心脏砰砰跳。眩晕和想吐的感觉持续到第二天，一睁眼就是晕乎，走路都有点打飘，睡醒立马服药了。\n脑子变得迟钝，一动就晕的不行，像晕车伴随着想吐","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2117628580364685668"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-11-03T13:47:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117614615072837912"],"id":"2117614615072837912","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1368,"like_count":29,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":3},"text":"这些天我吃不下东西，吞咽的时候总有一种阻塞的感觉。把这些不属于我的东西咽下，为了让机体运转，我用力进食。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2117614615072837912"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-11-03T13:21:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117608125645869201"],"id":"2117608125645869201","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":956,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"躁期自诩的哲学家人格顶号中。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2117608125645869201"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"1917047326990094336","name":"kiri","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1917047544313679872/akAJkXe1_normal.jpg","username":"0TwT012","verified":false}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"2117897607431496176","oldest_id":"2117608125645869201","result_count":9}}